    {
      "id": "XPc5ObRfcqb5J4zPoSFOQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2869.0633014122386,
      "y": 3329.4729955729645,
      "width": 758.6597900390625,
      "height": 1680,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b40",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1008673520,
      "version": 1116,
      "versionNonce": 2037336007,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760702069136,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "app/\n    \n    - app.routes.ts\n    - app.page.ts (no \"pages/\" because only one page...)\n    _components/\n    _utils/\n\n    auth/\n        _imports/\n        _pages/\n        _components/\n        _utils/\n            user.ts\n            user-service.ts\n\n    settings/\n        _imports/\n            (User, user.service)\n        _pages/\n            settings-main.page.ts\n        _components/\n        _utils/\n            settings.interface.ts\n            settings.service.ts\n\n    recurrency/\n        _imports/\n            (User, Settings, user.service, settings.service)\n        _pages/\n            recurrency-list/\n            recurrency-edit/\n        _utils/\n            recurrency.interface.ts\n            recurrency.service.ts\n        \n    brb/\n        _imports/\n            (User, Settings, user.service, settings.service)\n        _pages/\n            brb-list.page.ts\n        _components/\n        _utils/\n            brb.interface.ts\n            brb.service.ts\n\n    utils/\n        date/\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "app/\n    \n    - app.routes.ts\n    - app.page.ts (no \"pages/\" because only one page...)\n    _components/\n    _utils/\n\n    auth/\n        _imports/\n        _pages/\n        _components/\n        _utils/\n            user.ts\n            user-service.ts\n\n    settings/\n        _imports/\n            (User, user.service)\n        _pages/\n            settings-main.page.ts\n        _components/\n        _utils/\n            settings.interface.ts\n            settings.service.ts\n\n    recurrency/\n        _imports/\n            (User, Settings, user.service, settings.service)\n        _pages/\n            recurrency-list/\n            recurrency-edit/\n        _utils/\n            recurrency.interface.ts\n            recurrency.service.ts\n        \n    brb/\n        _imports/\n            (User, Settings, user.service, settings.service)\n        _pages/\n            brb-list.page.ts\n        _components/\n        _utils/\n            brb.interface.ts\n            brb.service.ts\n\n    utils/\n        date/\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "s1VELYsRoW2_Pd6ZZGga6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3925.9806993682014,
      "y": 3368.089874622112,
      "width": 982.7437133789062,
      "height": 910,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b41",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1238686224,
      "version": 1085,
      "versionNonce": 803256039,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760702069136,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GENERAL FOLDER STRUCTURE:\n\n_imports/ (lists imports from parent or other features modules)\n_types/ (should also include the services interfaces)\n_pages/ (smart)\n_components/ (dumb)\n_services/\n_utils/ (utility fns)\nfeature1/\nfeature2/\n\nWhere to put a new file:\n- is it a single file which doesn't require a feature module? \n    --> put it in app/ or in app/xyz\n- otherwise, create a new features module with general structure\n- create folder (_xyz) only if required (rule of thumb: more than 5 files)\n\n\n(copy-paste code):\n_components/\n_directives/\n_imports/\n_pages/\n_services\n_types/\n_utils/",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GENERAL FOLDER STRUCTURE:\n\n_imports/ (lists imports from parent or other features modules)\n_types/ (should also include the services interfaces)\n_pages/ (smart)\n_components/ (dumb)\n_services/\n_utils/ (utility fns)\nfeature1/\nfeature2/\n\nWhere to put a new file:\n- is it a single file which doesn't require a feature module? \n    --> put it in app/ or in app/xyz\n- otherwise, create a new features module with general structure\n- create folder (_xyz) only if required (rule of thumb: more than 5 files)\n\n\n(copy-paste code):\n_components/\n_directives/\n_imports/\n_pages/\n_services\n_types/\n_utils/",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
